<view class="page {{role}} "><view wx:if="{{denied}}" class="denied">{{denied}}<button class="primary" bindtap="home">返回首页</button></view><block wx:else><view class="heading-title">把好生意，变成好活动</view><view class="subtitle">先保存草稿，核实规则后再发布。</view><view class="card" style="margin-top:30rpx"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">活动名称</text><input value="{{form.name}}" bindinput="input" data-field="name" placeholder="给活动起个温暖的名字" maxlength="40"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">活动玩法</text><picker range="{{playTypes}}" value="{{playIndex}}" bindchange="playChange"><view class="picker">{{playTypes[playIndex]}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="field" wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="key"><text class="field-label">{{item.label}}</text><input value="{{form[item.key]}}" type="number" data-field="{{item.key}}" bindinput="input"/><view class="field-tip">{{item.tip}}</view></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">活动说明</text><textarea value="{{form.description}}" bindinput="input" data-field="description" placeholder="介绍一下你的好礼"/></view><view class="note">发布后概率快照锁定；如需修改，请结束后重新创建活动。中奖每次2注。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="saveActivity" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">保存草稿</button></view></block></view>